flowchart TD
  Start([Resolve a handle or DID]) --> Inputs[Read registered providers and local identity policy]
  Inputs --> Capability[Keep enabled providers with identity-resolution capability]
  Capability --> Public[Build unauthenticated public clients]
  Public --> Fanout[[Query every resolver concurrently]]
  Fanout --> DidDoc[Resolve each returned DID through its DID method and validate the PDS endpoint]
  DidDoc --> Claims[Retain provider ID, DID, endpoint, timestamp, and safe claim status]
  DidDoc --> Unavailable[Record resolver failures as unavailable]
  Claims --> Compare{All usable claims agree and no resolver is unavailable?}
  Compare -->|Yes| Verified[Return the claim with all provenance]
  Compare -->|No| Policy{Apply explicit local policy}
  Policy -->|Require agreement| Fail[Fail closed and expose disagreement or unavailable providers]
  Policy -->|Prefer provider| Preferred{Preferred verified claim exists?}
  Preferred -->|Yes| Explicit[Return selected claim with disputed/incomplete status]
  Preferred -->|No| Fail
  Policy -->|First verified| First{Any verified claim exists?}
  First -->|Yes| Explicit
  First -->|No| Fail
